OL,3,GNEWSAExisting cancer drugs might help
OL,4,Amore patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere have been "striking" missed
OL,7,Fopportunities to treat cancer patients
OL,8,Fwith drugs already approved for other
OL,9,Fforms of the disease, according to new
OL,10,Fresearch.
OL,12,FThe study from the University of
OL,13,FCambridge found about one in five
OL,14,Fcancers, and one in four cancers that
OL,15,Fhave spread, contained changes to their
OL,16,FDNA that could be targeted with
OL,17,Fexisting therapies.
OL,19,FMany targeted drugs have only been
OL,20,Fapproved for certain cancers, meaning
OL,21,Fthey cannot be used for other types
OL,22,Fwithout lengthy clinical trials.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
