OL,3,GNEWSAExisting cancer drugs might help
OL,4,Amore patients
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We may be missing opportunities to
OL,7,Ftreat cancers simply because we're
OL,8,Flooking for particular genetic changes
OL,9,Fin only certain types of cancer," said
OL,10,FProf Serena Nik-Zainal, the study's
OL,11,Fsenior author.
